at.com/#narrow/stream/187030-users/topic/quarkus-rest-client-reactive.20need.20to.20use.20.40RegisterProvider/near/245419083\r\n\r\n### Expected behavior\r\nThe following code should be enough to apply a filter\r\n@Provider  \r\npublic class LogClientResponseFilter implements ClientResponseFilter \r\nCurrently the following must also be done:\r\nIt also has to be registered to the interface:\r\n@RegisterProvider(LogClientResponseFilter.class)\r\n\r\n### Actual behavior\r\nThe filter is not applied to the resteasy interface\r\n\r\n\r\n## To Reproduce\r\n\r\n[rest-client-reactive-quickstart.tar.gz](https://github.com/quarkusio/quarkus/files/6790488/rest-client-reactive-quickstart.tar.gz)\r\n\r\n\r\nSteps to reproduce the behavior:\r\n1. run test, check output\r\n2. remove @RegisterProvider and verify that the output is missing\r\n\r\n\r\n## Environment (please complete the following information):\r\n\r\nuname -a\r\nLinux rhclient444.xxx 3.10.0-1160.6.1.el7.x86_64 #1 SMP Wed Oct 21 13:44:38 EDT 2020 x86_64 x86_64 x86_64 GNU/Linux\r\njava -version\r\nopenjdk version \"1.8.0_282\"\r\nOpenJDK Runtime Environment (build 1.8.0_282-b08)\r\nOpenJDK 64-Bit Server VM (build 25.282-b08, mixed mode)\r\nQuarkus version: 1.11.1.Final\r\nmvn -version\r\nApache Maven 3.6.3 (cecedd343002696d0abb50b32b541b8a6ba2883f)\r\nJava version: 1.8.0_192, vendor: Oracle Corporation, runtime: /home/xxx/opt/jdk-8u192_b12/jre\r\nDefault locale: en_US, platform encoding: UTF-8\r\nOS name: \"linux\", version: \"3.10.0-1160.6.1.el7.x86_64\", arch: \"amd64\", family: \"unix\"\r\n","closed_by":{"login":"michalszynkiewicz","id":3901322,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM5MDEzMjI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3901322?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/michalszynkiewicz","html_url":"https://github.com/michalszynkiewicz","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/michalszynkiewicz/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/michalszynkiewicz/following{/othe